--------------------------------------------
Physical security
--------------------------------------------
Barracades / Bollards:

    -Prevent access certain areas
    -used to channel people into a areas
    -Security notice, tell people this is secured

Access Control Vestibule:

    -All doors are normally unlocked
        -unlocking one door prevents others from being unlocked
    
    -One door open / other locked
        - When one is open the other cannot be unlocked
    
    One at a time controlled group, managed through an area

Used when you need more security for an area

Fencing:
    -used to build a perimeter
    -usually obvious
    -make robust
    -prevent climbing(razor wire)

Video Surveillance 
    -CCTV cameras
    -Object detection(Person's face or License Plate)

Security Guard
    - Validates Identification via badges
    - Two Persons usually to keep guard loyal
    - Access Badge to be worn(Security guard checks)

Lighting:
    -More light = attackers avoid lights
    -Avoid Shadows and Glare

Sensors:
    Cameras may have
        Infrared
            - Detects motion in dark and light
        Pressure
            -Detects a change in force in floor or window Sensors
        Microwave
            -Detects movement across large areas
        UltraSonic
            -Detects motion,collision,etc